  "ingredients": [
    "1/2 cup peanut butter",
    "1/4 cup coconut oil",
    "3 tablespoon low-carb maple syrup",
    "1 tablespoon vanilla extract",
    "2 1/2 cup almond flour",
    "1/4 cup erythritol",
    "1 1/2 teaspoon baking powder",
    "1/2 teaspoon salt",
    "30 gram low-carb dark chocolate (such as ChocoPerfection)"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "In a large mixing bowl, add the peanut butter, coconut oil, Ruled.Me Maple Syrup, and vanilla extract.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-buckeye-cookies/#wprm-recipe-51001-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/03/IMG_5445.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a separate bowl, combine the almond flour, erythritol, baking powder, and salt.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-buckeye-cookies/#wprm-recipe-51001-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/03/IMG_5449.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Using a hand mixer, mix together the wet ingredients.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-buckeye-cookies/#wprm-recipe-51001-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/03/IMG_5454.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sift the dry ingredients into the wet ingredients using a sieve or sifter.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-buckeye-cookies/#wprm-recipe-51001-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/03/IMG_5459.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix everything together to form a crumbly dough.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-buckeye-cookies/#wprm-recipe-51001-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/03/IMG_5467.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Knead the dough into a ball. Wrap in plastic wrap and refrigerate for 30 minutes.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-buckeye-cookies/#wprm-recipe-51001-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/03/IMG_5471.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Before getting the dough out, cut the sugar-free dark chocolate into small chunks (allow about 1–2 per cookie).",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-buckeye-cookies/#wprm-recipe-51001-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/03/IMG_5486.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat oven to 350F. Pull off small chunks of dough at a time. Press the chocolate into the dough.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-buckeye-cookies/#wprm-recipe-51001-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/03/IMG_5490.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Shape the dough around the chocolate to seal it inside, until the chocolate can no longer be seen.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-buckeye-cookies/#wprm-recipe-51001-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/03/IMG_5491.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Press the dough into a rounded tablespoon for consistent shape/sized cookies.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-buckeye-cookies/#wprm-recipe-51001-step-0-9",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/03/IMG_5496.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lay the cookies down on a Silpat covered baking tray with about 1\" in between.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-buckeye-cookies/#wprm-recipe-51001-step-0-10",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/03/IMG_5501.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake for 15–18 minutes. Optional: Broil for an additional 2–3 minutes to brown the tops.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-buckeye-cookies/#wprm-recipe-51001-step-0-11",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/03/IMG_5508.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Let cool and serve!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-buckeye-cookies/#wprm-recipe-51001-step-0-12",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
